# Directory spec for the project documentation site.

Spec: docs

Platform: Markdown/mkdocs

Purpose:
  The user and operator documentation published with mkdocs: concepts, CRD reference, package
  format and lifecycle, JukeBox sources, CLI reference, operations, and an English/French mirror.

Structure:
  ./*.md: Top-level English pages (index, concepts, architecture, crds, cli, installation,
    distribution, reconciliation, build-signing, gen-package)
  ./packages/: Package format, lifecycle, and portability
  ./jukebox/: Source types and registry maintenance
  ./operations/: Operations and security guidance
  ./tooling/: Package lint and test tooling
  ./fr/: French mirror, same structure and filenames

Owns:
  ./*.md
  ./tooling/**
  ./jukebox/**
  ./operations/**
  ./packages/**
  ./fr/**

Must:
  Keep the French mirror in structural parity with English: same paths and filenames, enforced by
    the CI parity check in /.github/workflows/workflows.sdd.
  Treat ./architecture.md as the authoritative description of crate responsibilities and the
    reconciliation flow.
  Describe the security posture of the cluster-admin agent and unverified package signatures.

Must not:
  Treat the retired ./conception/ directory as documentation; it is not owned and not published.

Depends on:
  ../mkdocs.yml
